<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

<p>
FirmSearch.org respects your privacy. This policy explains what information
may be collected when you use our website and how that information is used.
</p>

<h3>Information We Collect</h3>

<p>
When you submit a research request or contact us, we may collect information
such as your name, email address, and the details of your request.
</p>

<h3>How We Use Information</h3>

<p>
Information submitted to FirmSearch.org is used to respond to requests,
communicate with users, provide research services, and improve the website.
</p>

<h3>Email Communication</h3>

<p>
If you provide an email address, it may be used to communicate regarding your
research request or questions you submit.
</p>

<h3>Third-Party Services</h3>

<p>
FirmSearch.org may use third-party services, such as form processing or
payment providers, to help operate the website. These services may process
information according to their own privacy policies.
</p>

<h3>Information Sharing</h3>

<p>
FirmSearch.org does not sell personal information. We do not intentionally
share submitted personal information with third parties except when necessary
to operate the service, comply with legal obligations, or protect against
harmful or unlawful activity.
</p>

<h3>Data Security</h3>

<p>
We take reasonable steps to protect information submitted through the website.
However, no method of electronic transmission or storage can be guaranteed to
be completely secure.
</p>

